'''Vulcanizer (Deadly)''' is a special stage that was added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] and is available on the '''6th''' and the '''27th''' of every month if the player has previously completed all [[:Category:Crazed Cat Stages|Crazed Cat Stages]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it appears every '''Monday'''. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

